  "code": "ADT_A03",
  "name": "Discharge/end visit",
  "version": "HL7 v2.4",
  "chapter": "Patient Administration",
  "description": "An A03 event signals the end of a patient’s stay in a healthcare facility.  It signals that the patient’s status has changed to \"discharged\" and that a discharge date has been recorded.  The patient is no longer in the facility.  The patient’s location prior to discharge should be entered in PV1-3 - Assigned Patient Location.",
